# Instance with pattern syntax: [instance ClassName [pattern [...]]`: methods...]
[
  Equatable: [class [let Equatable a]
    eq: [Fn@Bool [a a]]]

  # New syntax: class name, then [pattern [...]], then colon, then methods
  EqInt: [instance Equatable [pattern [Int]]:
    eq: [fn [x y] [= x y]]]

  result: true
]

---

%.result
=== out
Bool(true)
